--- !u!114 &407686681
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 407686680}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6fc23b06f1c91bd4c847b7fc599d60ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InfoObraMuseo
  nombreObjeto: Sopwith Camel
  "textoES_Ni\xF1o": "El Sopwith Camel era un caza muy r\xE1pido y juguet\xF3n que
    los pilotos usaban en la Primera Guerra Mundial. Ten\xEDa una \u201Cjorobita\u201D
    delante, por eso lo llamaron Camel (\u201Ccamello\u201D). Giraba tan r\xE1pido
    que parec\xEDa un p\xE1jaro travieso en el cielo."
  "audioES_Ni\xF1o": {fileID: 0}
  textoES_Casual: "El caza m\xE1s famoso de la aviaci\xF3n brit\xE1nica de la Primera
    Guerra Mundial.\nEl Sopwith Camel destac\xF3 por su potencia, su agilidad y su
    caracter\xEDstico \u201Cjorobado\u201D que cubr\xEDa las ametralladoras. Era
    dif\xEDcil de pilotar, pero en manos expertas se convert\xEDa en un avi\xF3n
    extremadamente maniobrable. Sus victorias lo convirtieron en uno de los cazas
    m\xE1s emblem\xE1ticos de su \xE9poca."
  audioES_Casual: {fileID: 0}
  textoES_Experto: "El Sopwith Camel montaba un motor rotativo de fuerte par girosc\xF3pico,
    lo que lo hac\xEDa extremadamente sensible en maniobras: pod\xEDa girar a la
    derecha con una rapidez excepcional, pero requer\xEDa gran pericia para volarlo
    con seguridad. Su dise\xF1o compacto, con la masa concentrada alrededor del centro
    de gravedad, mejoraba la aceleraci\xF3n en giros, convirti\xE9ndolo en un arma
    eficaz en combates cerrados. Su historial de derribos lo posiciona como uno de
    los cazas aliados m\xE1s influyentes de la guerra."
  audioES_Experto: {fileID: 0}
  "textoEN_Ni\xF1o": "The Sopwith Camel was a fast, lively fighter used in World
    War I. It had a little \u201Chump\u201D in front, which is why it was called
    the Camel. It could turn so quickly that it looked like a mischievous bird in
    the sky."
  "audioEN_Ni\xF1o": {fileID: 0}
  textoEN_Casual: "The Sopwith Camel stood out for its power, agility, and its distinctive
    \u201Chump\u201D that housed the machine guns. It was hard to fly, but in skilled
    hands it became an incredibly maneuverable aircraft. Its combat record made it
    one of the era\u2019s most iconic fighters."
  audioEN_Casual: {fileID: 0}
  textoEN_Experto: 'The Sopwith Camel used a rotary engine with strong gyroscopic
    torque, making it extremely responsive: it could roll and turn right with remarkable
    speed, but required skilled pilots to avoid losing control. Its compact design,
    with mass concentrated near the center of gravity, enhanced turn acceleration,
    making it deadly in tight dogfights. Its combat achievements rank it among the
    most influential Allied fighters of the war.'
  audioEN_Experto: {fileID: 0}
