--- !u!114 &571039253
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 571039252}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6fc23b06f1c91bd4c847b7fc599d60ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InfoObraMuseo
  nombreObjeto: Bell 206 JetRanger
  "textoES_Ni\xF1o": "El Bell 206 es un helic\xF3ptero \xE1gil que puede volar bajo
    y r\xE1pido, como un p\xE1jaro. Se usa para viajar, explorar y divertirse en
    el cielo."
  "audioES_Ni\xF1o": {fileID: 0}
  textoES_Casual: "El Bell 206 JetRanger se ha usado ampliamente en transporte civil,
    patrulla, filmaci\xF3n a\xE9rea y entrenamiento. Su dise\xF1o confiable, cabina
    espaciosa y facilidad de mantenimiento lo hicieron uno de los helic\xF3pteros
    m\xE1s populares del mundo."
  audioES_Casual: {fileID: 0}
  textoES_Experto: "El Bell 206 combina un rotor principal de dos palas, motor turboshaft
    y tren de aterrizaje triciclo, ofreciendo maniobrabilidad y eficiencia en operaciones
    civiles y paramilitares. Su estructura simple y ligera permite costos de operaci\xF3n
    bajos y alta disponibilidad, lo que lo convierte en un est\xE1ndar global en
    helic\xF3pteros utilitarios de un solo motor."
  audioES_Experto: {fileID: 0}
  "textoEN_Ni\xF1o": "The Bell 206 is an agile helicopter that can fly low and fast,
    like a bird. It\u2019s used for traveling, exploring, and having fun in the sky."
  "audioEN_Ni\xF1o": {fileID: 0}
  textoEN_Casual: "The Bell 206 JetRanger has been widely used for civil transport,
    patrol, aerial filming, and training. Its reliable design, spacious cabin, and
    ease of maintenance make it one of the world\u2019s most popular helicopters."
  audioEN_Casual: {fileID: 0}
  textoEN_Experto: The Bell 206 features a two-blade main rotor, turboshaft engine,
    and tricycle landing gear, providing agility and efficiency for civil and paramilitary
    operations. Its simple, lightweight structure allows low operating costs and
    high availability, making it a global standard among single-engine utility helicopters.
  audioEN_Experto: {fileID: 0}
