--- !u!114 &722422094
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 722422093}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6fc23b06f1c91bd4c847b7fc599d60ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::AvionInteractivo
  nombreObjeto: Otto Lilienthal Glider (1894)
  "textoES_Ni\xF1o": "\xA1Imagina poder volar como un p\xE1jaro! Este invento fue
    uno de los primeros \u201Caviones\u201D del mundo. Otto Lilienthal se sujetaba
    a sus alas enormes y corr\xEDa cuesta abajo hasta elevarse por el aire. \xA1Fue
    uno de los primeros superh\xE9roes del vuelo!"
  "audioES_Ni\xF1o": {fileID: 8300000, guid: 65a9086c5380f5d4f831d9e1f07bdfe8, type: 3}
  textoES_Casual: "Una joya pionera de la aviaci\xF3n: este planeador represent\xF3
    el paso decisivo entre so\xF1ar con volar e intentarlo realmente. Con su dise\xF1o
    inspirado en las alas de las aves y un control corporal intuitivo, Lilienthal
    realiz\xF3 m\xE1s de 2.000 vuelos\u2014demostrando que el vuelo humano era posible."
  audioES_Casual: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e5a2bbbc92cc4e44f97e3f7b8f3c1a59, type: 3}
  textoES_Experto: "Este planeador es un hito fundamental en la aeron\xE1utica: su
    configuraci\xF3n monoplano de estructura de madera y envergadura arqueada sent\xF3
    las bases del an\xE1lisis aerodin\xE1mico moderno. Lilienthal introdujo principios
    de estabilidad, sustentaci\xF3n y control mediante desplazamiento del centro
    de masa, aportando datos experimentales que influir\xEDan directamente en los
    hermanos Wright y en el desarrollo de la aviaci\xF3n cient\xEDfica."
  audioES_Experto: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 000fad45cecb7b94092a39f1b684803f, type: 3}
  "textoEN_Ni\xF1o": "Imagine you could fly like a bird! This invention was one of
    the first \u201Cairplanes\u201D ever made. Otto Lilienthal held onto its big
    wings and ran down hills until he lifted into the sky. He was one of the very
    first flying superheroes!"
  "audioEN_Ni\xF1o": {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0485752a4c9557e4792ccc500eb4a614, type: 3}
  textoEN_Casual: "A pioneering jewel of early aviation: this glider marked the bold
    leap from dreaming about flight to truly attempting it. With bird-inspired wings
    and body-weight control, Lilienthal completed over 2,000 flights\u2014proving
    human flight could become real."
  audioEN_Casual: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 34bfad4f0a0e7fa46a9ef10828f36b96, type: 3}
  textoEN_Experto: 'This glider stands as a cornerstone of aeronautical history:
    its wooden monoplane frame and cambered wing geometry helped establish the foundations
    of modern aerodynamic analysis. Lilienthal introduced principles of stability,
    lift, and body-weight control, providing experimental data that directly influenced
    the Wright brothers and the evolution of scientific aviation.'
  audioEN_Experto: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d4007a175705da14fbe7e90ff49f4e31, type: 3}
