--- !u!114 &889633828
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 889633827}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6fc23b06f1c91bd4c847b7fc599d60ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InfoObraMuseo
  nombreObjeto: Boeing B-17
  "textoES_Ni\xF1o": "El B-17 era un avi\xF3n enorme que llevaba muchas ventanas
    y torretas para protegerse. Por eso lo llamaban \u201CFortaleza Volante\u201D.
    Volaba muy lejos y muy alto, llevando a su tripulaci\xF3n como si fueran dentro
    de un castillo en el cielo."
  "audioES_Ni\xF1o": {fileID: 0}
  textoES_Casual: "El Boeing B-17 se hizo famoso por su resistencia: pod\xEDa volver
    a casa incluso con grandes da\xF1os. Utilizado principalmente en bombardeos de
    largo alcance, su robustez y su impresionante defensa lo convirtieron en un s\xEDmbolo
    del poder a\xE9reo aliado."
  audioES_Casual: {fileID: 0}
  textoES_Experto: "El B-17 integraba estructura semimonocasco, motores radialmente
    refrigerados y m\xFAltiples posiciones defensivas que le otorgaban una capacidad
    excepcional para mantener vuelo tras recibir impactos. Su autonom\xEDa y su techo
    operativo lo hicieron clave en las campa\xF1as de bombardeo diurno sobre Europa.
    Aunque cargaba menos bombas que otros modelos posteriores, su precisi\xF3n y
    fiabilidad lo consolidaron como uno de los bombarderos m\xE1s influyentes de
    la guerra."
  audioES_Experto: {fileID: 0}
  "textoEN_Ni\xF1o": "The B-17 was a huge airplane filled with windows and turrets
    for protection. That\u2019s why they called it the \u201CFlying Fortress.\u201D
    It flew far and high, carrying its crew as if they were inside a castle in the
    sky."
  "audioEN_Ni\xF1o": {fileID: 0}
  textoEN_Casual: 'The Boeing B-17 became famous for its toughness: it could return
    home even after heavy damage. Used mainly for long-range bombing missions, its
    durability and strong defensive armament made it a symbol of Allied air power.'
  audioEN_Casual: {fileID: 0}
  textoEN_Experto: "The B-17 featured a semi-monocoque structure, air-cooled radial
    engines, and extensive defensive gun positions, giving it exceptional ability
    to stay airborne after sustaining damage. Its range and high operating ceiling
    made it central to the daylight bombing campaigns over Europe. Although it carried
    fewer bombs than later designs, its accuracy and reliability cemented its reputation
    as one of the war\u2019s most influential bombers."
  audioEN_Experto: {fileID: 0}
