--- !u!114 &1785200578
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1785200577}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6fc23b06f1c91bd4c847b7fc599d60ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InfoObraMuseo
  nombreObjeto: "UH-1 \u201CHuey\u201D"
  "textoES_Ni\xF1o": "El UH-1, llamado \u201CHuey\u201D, pod\xEDa volar muy r\xE1pido
    y llevar personas o cosas. Su sonido \u201C\xA1huuu-ey!\u201D lo hac\xEDa f\xE1cil
    de reconocer en el cielo."
  "audioES_Ni\xF1o": {fileID: 0}
  textoES_Casual: "El Huey se hizo famoso durante la Guerra de Vietnam por su versatilidad.
    Pod\xEDa transportar tropas, evacuar heridos y llevar armas ligeras. Su dise\xF1o
    simple y confiable lo convirti\xF3 en un helic\xF3ptero legendario en operaciones
    militares y de ayuda humanitaria."
  audioES_Casual: {fileID: 0}
  textoES_Experto: "El UH-1 emplea un rotor principal de dos palas y motor turboshaft
    Lycoming T53, optimizado para fiabilidad y mantenimiento sencillo. Su fuselaje
    estrecho y espacioso permite transporte r\xE1pido de personal y carga. Gracias
    a su capacidad de operar en entornos hostiles y su versatilidad t\xE1ctica, se
    convirti\xF3 en la columna vertebral de la aviaci\xF3n de apoyo a\xE9reo ligero
    durante d\xE9cadas."
  audioES_Experto: {fileID: 0}
  "textoEN_Ni\xF1o": "The UH-1, nicknamed \u201CHuey,\u201D could fly fast and carry
    people or cargo. Its \u201Chuuu-ey\u201D sound made it easy to spot in the sky."
  "audioEN_Ni\xF1o": {fileID: 0}
  textoEN_Casual: The Huey became famous during the Vietnam War for its versatility.
    It could carry troops, evacuate the wounded, and carry light weapons. Its simple
    and reliable design made it a legendary helicopter in military and humanitarian
    operations.
  audioEN_Casual: {fileID: 0}
  textoEN_Experto: The UH-1 uses a two-blade main rotor and a Lycoming T53 turboshaft
    engine, optimized for reliability and simple maintenance. Its narrow yet spacious
    fuselage allows rapid troop and cargo transport. Its ability to operate in hostile
    environments and tactical versatility made it a backbone of light air support
    aviation for decades.
  audioEN_Experto: {fileID: 0}
